  1262                                  ; ------------------------------------------------------------
  1263                                  ; update_cursor: tells the VGA hardware where to draw the
  1264                                  ; blinking text cursor, based on cursor_row/cursor_col.
  1265                                  ;
  1266                                  ; The CRT Controller has an index port (0x3D4) and a data port
  1267                                  ; (0x3D5). Register 0x0E = cursor position high byte,
  1268                                  ; register 0x0F = cursor position low byte. The position is a
  1269                                  ; single number: row * 80 + col.
